{"4226540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hidden Paradise: Kiwi Christmas Collector's Edition", "steam_appid": 4226540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226540/extras/36b1fa8882af06749a90800ed10768d7.avif?t=1768207540\" width=1200 height=460 /></span>Hidden Paradise invites you into a warm, festive escape where holiday spirit meets sunlit New Zealand charm. While a gentle backstory ties the world together, the heart of the experience lies in exploring beautifully crafted scenes and unraveling a delightful variety of puzzles designed to spark curiosity and comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Garcia family as they celebrate Christmas the Kiwi way: starting with a cozy morning of decorating, then stepping into the vibrant summer glow of Auckland. From strolling along Queen Street to wandering through lush parks and seaside paths, they uncover festive sights, heartfelt moments, and touches of magic that turn each corner of the city into a holiday treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle in for a captivating mix of hidden object challenges and engaging mini-games. No matter if you’re seeking cleverly concealed items or testing your logic in bite-sized puzzling moments, every scene brings something new to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Dozens of atmospheric hidden object scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Exploration of Auckland’s iconic landmarks and must-see spots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Turn on your magnifying glass and explore the scenes in detail so you don’t miss a single find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Festive activities: match tree ornaments, spot tiny differences, assemble garlands, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Collect joyful souvenirs along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 A wide range of unique mini-games and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Earn achievements to celebrate your progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Wander through sparkling streets, glowing parks, sunny beaches, and cozy cafés</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrap yourself in the warmth of a Kiwi-style Christmas and enjoy a relaxing holiday adventure filled with charm, color, and discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226540/extras/36b1fa8882af06749a90800ed10768d7.avif?t=1768207540\" width=1200 height=460 /></span>Hidden Paradise invites you into a warm, festive escape where holiday spirit meets sunlit New Zealand charm. While a gentle backstory ties the world together, the heart of the experience lies in exploring beautifully crafted scenes and unraveling a delightful variety of puzzles designed to spark curiosity and comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Garcia family as they celebrate Christmas the Kiwi way: starting with a cozy morning of decorating, then stepping into the vibrant summer glow of Auckland. From strolling along Queen Street to wandering through lush parks and seaside paths, they uncover festive sights, heartfelt moments, and touches of magic that turn each corner of the city into a holiday treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle in for a captivating mix of hidden object challenges and engaging mini-games. No matter if you’re seeking cleverly concealed items or testing your logic in bite-sized puzzling moments, every scene brings something new to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p 